osed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-28T21:18:06Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T14:10:31Z","closed_at":"2025-07-30T14:09:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nMaster(https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0dd9178269e447aca805bc4b4a9a840119c10275) (Couple days old)\n\n### System information\n\n-\n\n### Issue description\n\nWas thinking a bit more about https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109012. How come `11.0/255.0` gets saved as `0.04313725` in the scene file when there are two closer decimal representations? Well it seems the fault lies with the color picker sliders (doesn't invalidate the pr - rounding is still the correct approach as `10.9999983943998813629150390625` should still definitely result in choosing 11 not 10).\n\nWhen setting a slider to an integer value in RGB mode, the picked color float value is not the closest presentable float value. E.g. Color #0b0000, red channel:\n```\n0.04313725490196078371507582005506 - double, 11 / 255\n0.0431372560560703277587890625 - Color.html(#0b0000)\n0.0431372560560703277587890625 - Color8(11, 11, 11)\n0.0431372560560703277587890625 - Color picker, html #0b0000\n0.0431372486054897308349609375 - Color picker, slider 11 (2 bits off from closest possible)\n```\nWhy important? Multiplying and flooring yields different values:\n```\n0.0431372560560703277587890625 * 255.0 = 11.0000002942979335784912109375\n0.0431372486054897308349609375 * 255.0 = 10.9999983943998813629150390625\n```\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Choose a value in color picker using sliders in RGB mode\n2. Compare the value to setting it using html.\n3. Observe that the values don't match.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[picker-underreperesented.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21477412/picker-underreperesented.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com